  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "跨文化行銷溝通",
    "sub_ename": "CROSS-CULTURAL  MARKETING  COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "與不同文化背景的人聯繫比以往更容易，但有效的溝通卻是一項挑戰。本課程介紹文化對行銷傳播的影響，以及設計目標受眾認同的行銷傳播的重要性。主要課題包括行銷傳播的基礎、接觸點、文化背景、文化價值觀及非語言溝通。課程介紹分析文化差異與相似性的工具，幫助學生發展檢查偏見和避免誤解所需的技能，發展批判性思考技能，並結合所有這些技能來規劃和創造跨文化行銷訊息。",
    "describe_eh": "Connecting with people from different cultures is easier than ever, but effective communications are a challenge. This course introduces the influences of culture on marketing communications and the importance of designing marketing communications that the target audience identifies with. Key topics include the foundations of marketing communications, touch points, cultural context, cultural values, and non-verbal communication. The course introduces tools to analyze cultural differences and similarities, helps students develop the skills needed to check biases and avoid misunderstandings, develop critical thinking skills, and combine all these skills to plan and create cross-cultural marketing messages.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
